<title>SWEDEN: Diligentia opens at 82 skr on trade debut.</title>
<headline>Diligentia opens at 82 skr on trade debut.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1996-09-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Swedish property company Diligentia, recently spun off to shareholders in commercial bank S-E-Banken, opened on their Stockholm bourse debut at 82 crowns.  </p>
<p>Trade in the share was brisk, and over 60,000 had changed hands by 0830 GMT, by which time the share had slipped to 80.50 crowns.</p>
<p>-- Stockholm newsroom, +46-8-700 1006</p>
